## Sanitizer policy

Reuse `PolicyDeepSeek` for OpenRouter traffic — pass the `thinking` object through.

## Upstream config

| Item        | Value                          |
| ----------- | ------------------------------ |
| Default URL | `https://openrouter.ai/api/v1` |

## Credits endpoint

`GET https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/credits` returns `data.total_credits` and `data.total_usage`. Remaining credits = `total_credits - total_usage`. The balance is returned as USD (not a credit count). The endpoint may require a management key; on 401/403 surface an error string in the UI tooltip.

